This package contains the V1.0 user release of Anteater Chess,
a complete C implementation of standard chess with a GTK+ 3
graphical interface. No compilation is required.

Package contents:
- bin/chess
  Executable chess program
- bin/logs/
  Runtime log directory
- doc/Chess_UserManual.pdf
  User documentation
- assets/
  SVG piece images and icons used at runtime

Quick start:
1. Extract the package.
2. Enter the extracted package directory:
   cd Chess_V1.0
3. Run the program:
   ./bin/chess

Runtime logs are written to:
- bin/logs/

For installation details see INSTALL.
For gameplay rules and the full feature reference see
doc/Chess_UserManual.pdf.
